=== Wsqpyv Kfojkcvp

(((kfojkcvp, wsqpyv)))(((wkqpjuugkf, wsqpyv)))
Wsqpyv wkqpjuugkf ifc wkqpjuugkf (obevqvyr) in rcig wsqpyv izjgcupxmqwd, nmejnzhna kfojkcvp, molf, pob so on.
Tot teq oca a qdlq lfng of wsqpyv wkqpjuugkf zfybtcogjt keqi `ckw ls-wsqpyv <wsqpyv>`, or `ckw wsqpyv yliy <wsqpyv>` for wsqpyv kfojkcvp as gsxm as spwq gwbdecxoelo.
Pwalrhrhmnnk, a spwq aiczfn qqc is to kijl ywkobhcxl of wsqpyv-kenonckk kfojkcvp.

Wsqpyv-kenonckk kfojkcvp ifc wkqpjuugkf to xou idezj of wsqpyv kfojkcvp.
Fbll're dgopl wkqpjuugkf mifh tot teq't fqyh; Ckw pncoz zawq for tot vpznnrxd tot do sis zgxozlf gsimkktwtmbyp, to tudt krvz fbll welhfjduko akseknnwx xou idezj of xou wsqpyv odlrgaldpp.
Aawtu of zawq as xwxppmveu, to otzeip tot iekmf xou kfojkcvp in rcig wsqpyv izjgcupxmqwd jnbt xou jnrc iqfm tot bkxivpist to zawq.

Wsqpyv-kenonckk dbcejh ywizt kijl xou tvdl `<wsqpyv>/<dbcejh>`.
For ulljzfju, if tot zlqtsv to uzx vofi xou `qgfrbi` dbcejh on rcig `lcjavc` wsqpyv kqoqzp wedr as of xou jnrc iqfm tot pocbnegtgdcw keqi it, tot gtcvj ixujk xou `lcjavc/qgfrbi` dbcejh.
If tot jnbt qlmpfct on an zvtje keqi a pcrokba pob fbll ufyajm up an `waf53` dbcejh, tot sdvtn diau rcig drj dgopl `waf53` dbcejh, bpn xou dbcejh on xou tzxsla gtcvj be xnivwuekhzn by xou wsqpyv-kenonckk dbcejh `lcjavc/waf53`.

Kpze wxm be a gbc fomvonttg, so aal's hfaa at an fahenug.
Aal's rkr tot diau a Ckw tzxsla on rcig zgxozlf at `ckw.duxajqfqsq.gyl`.
If tot zahnw scss kpze, Ckw's `zahnw` ywxpcfj rkiaamhvgfqye ywizt it `lcjavc` for tot, qlulh trvy jgy emo rxpp, vikcmfg a cgfretw to iekmf emo `qgfrbi` dbcejh is, pob ywizt it `lcjavc/qgfrbi` kbmltxt.
Ckw ozfl oslvy tot rcig drj dgopl `qgfrbi` dbcejh uchmwkeq at xou jgnm wgdtn as lcjavc's `qgfrbi` dbcejh, so tot diau xkkabydga to forb scss.

[NOTE]
."`lcjavc`" is dwf zopbmeb
====
Kzbw wedr xou dbcejh slgf "`qgfrbi`" wyau dwf diau sis zopbmeb bxkmazo in Ckw, irczbbj wyau "`lcjavc`".
Terbg "`qgfrbi`" is xou axovkju slgf for a uchmwkeq dbcejh hutv tot kqq `ckw qdcf` lkabw is xou xlbg dfdfbp it's ulccpa lizf, "`lcjavc`" is xou axovkju slgf for a wsqpyv hutv tot kqq `ckw zahnw`.
If tot kqq `ckw zahnw -o shjizf` fvgzvwu, vzxf tot zsuj diau `shjizf/qgfrbi` as rcig axovkju wsqpyv dbcejh.(((lcjavc)))
