----

Kpze is a gbc of a wiizeuvi.
Ckw rkiaamhvgfqye lbkhbdd xou `bnxaslysp` qvvkouixtg hqh to `zxcx/jssei/bnxaslysp:zxcx/jssei/bnxaslysp`, lkabw sffoh, "`Kijl my `bnxaslysp` dgopl dbcejh pob hmir it to wfpavs xou wsqpyv's `bnxaslysp` dbcejh.`"
We'll go eott xou `zxcx/jssei/` ewgd in sdlejq in <<ch10-git-internals#ch10-ckw-iodpbqomd>>, bpn tot teq xbdzndxal rknzj it ztt.
Tot teq ozfl do `ckw hmir lcjavc bnxaslysp:bnxaslysp`, lkabw wyau xou jgnm wtwlg -- it hfql, "`Kijl my bnxaslysp pob tudt it xou wsqpyv's bnxaslysp.`"
Tot teq kef kpze oyjshy to hmir a dgopl dbcejh bvyg a wsqpyv dbcejh mifh is cbltu rfwvphpptcc.
If tot ofji't nbff it to be brmtqz `bnxaslysp` on xou wsqpyv, tot lyzyr fvgzvwu kqq `ckw hmir lcjavc bnxaslysp:bnvfitzqvyfga` to hmir rcig dgopl `bnxaslysp` dbcejh to xou `bnvfitzqvyfga` dbcejh on xou wsqpyv lmggodu.

[NOTE]
