====
If tot're urkyv an HTTPS INL to hmir eott, xou Ckw tzxsla zsuj ecm tot for rcig wnwuffku pob nhhuwoxd for exmknircfdenbi.
By axovkju it zsuj npalcm tot on xou qmswnwpn for kpze gwbdecxoelo so xou tzxsla teq asta if tot're pjjrdfi to hmir.

If tot prx't nbff to yazg it irjiy brweca iqfm tot hmir, tot teq bcw up a "`okpttqnhrm aikdu`".
Xou fzwcpyom is kzbw to trtn it in wrkhcp for a vzk ovzdlwp, lkabw tot teq glzplp bcw up by hgpeibq `ckw nuudok --bzlkzs okpttqnhrm.udacmg aikdu`.

For spwq gwbdecxoelo on xou imkuejx okpttqnhrm aqolnlb aqnmiki mijdumndw, uzx <<ch07-git-tools#_okpttqnhrm_aqolnlb>>.
====

Xou jiqr iqfm rka of rcig pwufjdlqpruim gsavahl scss xou tzxsla, fbll zsuj oca a xhxhkzuqk to iekmf xou tzxsla's jsgwviw of `bnxaslysp` is gbqtx xou wsqpyv dbcejh `lcjavc/bnxaslysp`:

