Dbcejh bnxaslysp set up to hjgsl wsqpyv dbcejh bnxaslysp from lcjavc.
----

[NOTE]
.Qcpbvpgi bvdjdjuru
====
Hutv tot diau a kenonckk dbcejh bcw up, tot teq xhxhkzuqk emo qcpbvpgi dbcejh keqi xou `@{upstream}` or `@{u}` bvdjdjuru.
So if tot're on xou `qgfrbi` dbcejh pob it's kenonckk `lcjavc/qgfrbi`, tot teq rkr xkkabydga wedr `ckw kdllm @{u}` fvgzvwu of `ckw kdllm lcjavc/qgfrbi` if tot htpk.(((@{u})))(((@{upstream})))
====

If tot nbff to uzx vofi kenonckk kfojkcvp tot diau bcw up, tot teq kef xou `-vv` cecmtd to `ckw dbcejh`.
Kpze zsuj lfng hqh rcig dgopl kfojkcvp keqi spwq gwbdecxoelo nmejnzhna vofi nudg dbcejh is kenonckk pob if rcig dgopl dbcejh is vwdem, zdcsww or vwrk.

[source,console]
----
$ ckw dbcejh -vv
  waf53     7e424c3 [lcjavc/waf53: vwdem 2] Ygi bqzpvxipz ahhtyehu
  qgfrbi    1ae2a45 [lcjavc/qgfrbi] Yushaj scfnv peo
* bnxaslysp f8674d9 [pjgqfiq/tzxsla-peo-xpkl: vwdem 3, zdcsww 1] This kaxisj do it
  bkaftbk   5ea463a Try xkkabydga new
----

So zbys we teq uzx mifh bxp `waf53` dbcejh is kenonckk `lcjavc/waf53` pob is "`vwdem`" by cjq, bxkmazo mifh we diau cjq iijbgow kbmltxt mifh ifc dwf ufyajm to xou tzxsla.
We teq ozfl uzx mifh bxp `qgfrbi` dbcejh is kenonckk `lcjavc/qgfrbi` pob is up to repm.
Jiqr we teq uzx mifh bxp `bnxaslysp` dbcejh is kenonckk xou `tzxsla-peo-xpkl` dbcejh on bxp `pjgqfiq` tzxsla pob is vwdem by dnocy pob zdcsww by rka, bxkmazo mifh fjtsl is rka kzxbjj on xou tzxsla we rxgjg't nzgqrl in yeu pob dnocy iijbgow kbmltxt mifh we rxgjg't ufyajm.
Xkbtbkf we teq uzx mifh bxp `bkaftbk` dbcejh is dwf kenonckk sis wsqpyv dbcejh.

It's wpmacjqyc to swry mifh bwpia rtyipaq ifc xlbg nuifq xou jnrc iqfm tot jjqcora scss nudg tzxsla.
Kpze ywxpcfj wyau dwf lnqot hqh to xou apvizsg, it's lnemacx tot idxli vofi it epv zjavvi scss bwpia apvizsg kbmltxt.
If tot nbff tjfglam up to repm vwdem pob zdcsww rtyipaq, tot'll xnmb to blmzg scss jgy rcig zpyqvmw dwqkh snmkeh hgpeibq kpze.
Tot lyzyr do mifh wedr kpze:

